## Practical Notes

| Pillar            | Focus                              | Example Impact                          |
|-------------------|------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|
| Confidentiality   | Unauthorized access                | Data leak, credential theft             |
| Integrity         | Unauthorized modification          | Altered records, tampered transactions  |
| Availability      | Systems/services unavailable       | Downtime, DDoS, ransomware lockout      |

When analyzing any incident, ask:
1. Was data exposed? → Confidentiality  
2. Was data changed? → Integrity  
3. Were services unavailable? → Availability  

